          "details": "Run 'npx shadcn@latest init' to complete setup, configure components.json with appropriate style settings (New York style with Zinc base color), resolve any peer dependency issues with '--legacy-peer-deps' flag, and update any deprecated React.ElementRef to React.ComponentRef",
