            3
          ],
          "details": "Build Header (with production status indicators), Sidebar (with process navigation), Footer (with system status), and Page Container components that support real-time monitoring dashboards and production control interfaces\n<info added on 2025-05-23T22:50:01.235Z>\nLAYOUT REQUIREMENTS:\n\nHEADER COMPONENT:\n- Whiskey House Kentucky branding/logo\n- User info display (email, current date/time)\n- Select dropdown for user/context switching\n- Production status indicators\n\nSIDEBAR NAVIGATION:\n- HOME, SCHEDULING, CONFIG, RECIPE MANAGEMENT, LINE OVERVIEW sections\n- Collapsible/expandable navigation\n- Active state indication\n- Process navigation\n\nTHREE-PANEL LAYOUT PATTERN (Production Scheduling):\n- Left Panel: Lists/filters (Production Orders with \"View All\" toggles, search)\n- Center Panel: Main data table with complex multi-column structure\n- Right Panel: Forms/details (Add to Schedule, Edit Order modals)\n\nPAGE CONTAINER:\n- Support for real-time monitoring dashboards and production control interfaces\n- Modal overlays for complex forms\n- Responsive breakpoints for factory floor devices\n- Clean transitions between sections\n- System status in footer\n</info added on 2025-05-23T22:50:01.235Z>\n<info added on 2025-05-24T17:45:20.519Z>\nLAYOUT COMPONENTS IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY:\n\n✅ COMPREHENSIVE LAYOUT SYSTEM IMPLEMENTED:\n1. MESHeader Component - Full whiskey production branding, real-time status indicators, user info, production metrics\n2. MESSidebar Component - Complete navigation system with equipment status monitoring\n3. PageContainer Component - Responsive layout with mobile support and footer integration  \n4. ThreePanelLayout Component - Specialized for production scheduling workflows\n5. Footer Component - System status and operational indicators\n\n✅ MANUFACTURING-SPECIFIC FEATURES:\n- \"WhisKey House Kentucky\" branding with factory icon\n- Production status badges (3/5 Lines Active, Day Shift, 87% Efficiency)\n- Equipment monitoring (Mashing01: Running, Fermentation01: Idle, Distillation01: Maintenance)\n- Whiskey customer codes (BHK, PAW, HNW, ABT) with realistic production data\n- Mash bill format integration (75-21-04-00, 60-40-00-00)\n- Real-time timestamps and user role display\n\n✅ RESPONSIVE AND FACTORY-OPTIMIZED DESIGN:\n- Mobile-responsive navigation with sheet overlay\n- Collapsible sidebar for different screen sizes\n- High contrast indicators for factory floor visibility\n- Touch-friendly interface elements\n- Real-time data display throughout interface\n\n✅ TESTING VERIFICATION:\n- Browser testing confirmed all components rendering properly on localhost:3000/scheduling\n- Three-panel layout functioning with production orders, schedule table, and order form\n- Navigation system working with proper active states\n- Theme system integrated throughout layout components\n- All manufacturing data displaying correctly with appropriate formatting\n\n✅ INTEGRATION WITH EXISTING COMPONENTS:\n- Seamless integration with existing DatePicker, NumericInput, and Select components\n- Theme system compatibility across all layout elements\n- Equipment status integration using StatusDot components\n- Manufacturing-specific styling consistent with overall design system\n\nThe layout system is now complete and ready to support all MES interface requirements, providing a solid foundation for whiskey production monitoring and control interfaces.\n</info added on 2025-05-24T17:45:20.519Z>",
